 "hook": "As it has in the past, the US Census Bureau is encouraging residents to respond to the 2020 Census’s mailed questionnaire, which reduces the need for in-person census-taking. The agency calculates these \"self-response\" rates all the way down to individual Census tracts, and provides that data as a CSV and via its API.",
